            "y": 6538
          },
          "code": "IDENTIFY_THE_USER_QUERIES_TYPE",
          "id": "1775462320837",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775462320839_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an intent classification assistant for Oracle HCM Data Loader (HSDL). Classify the user query into ONE of the following categories:\n\n### HIGHEST PRIORITY RULE (MANDATORY)\n1. If the query contains any reference to the agent, including words like: \"advisor\", \"agent\", \"this tool\",\n   \"loader advisor\", \"spreadsheet loader advisor\", OR is asking what the tool/agent does or how it works,\n   including the exact question \"What does the Spreadsheet Data Loader Advisor do?\", → ALWAYS classify it as AGENT_QUERY.\n2. Else if the query is the exact question \"Help me load data from a CSV file\", → ALWAYS classify it as UPLOAD_QUERY.\n3. Else if the query is a question (starts with or contains phrases like: \"how\", \"what\", \"why\", \"when\", \"where\",\n   \"can I\", \"how do I\", \"how can I\" OR ends with a \"?\"), → ALWAYS classify it as HSDL_QUERY.\n\n### Categories:\n1. HSDL_LOAD_REQUEST\n   - User is explicitly asking to initiate, execute, or process a data load.\n   - The query is an action request (not a question).\n   - Typically contains:\n     - Template Code (e.g., ORA_*, TEST_*).\n     - Business Object (e.g., Worker, Job).\n   - The query is NOT a question.\n   - Contains action words like \"load\", \"initiate\", \"upload\", \"rollback\".\n   - Examples:\n     - \"Load Worker using template ORA_WORKER\".\n     - \"Initiate load for Job business object\".\n     - \"Upload data using TEST_JOB\".\n     - Any sentence that follows the pattern: \"initiate/load/upload HSDL load with <TEMPLATE_CODE>\" MUST be classified as HSDL_LOAD_REQUEST.\n\n2. AGENT_QUERY\n   - User is asking about the Spreadsheet Data Loader Advisor (agent), its purpose, capabilities, or behavior.\n   - Queries containing \"advisor\", \"agent\", \"this tool\", \"loader advisor\", \"spreadsheet loader advisor\".\n   - The exact question \"What does the Spreadsheet Data Loader Advisor do?\" MUST trigger AGENT_QUERY.\n   - Examples:\n     - \"What does the Spreadsheet Data Loader Advisor do?\".\n     - \"What does my Spreadsheet Loader advisor do?\".\n     - \"How does this agent work?\".\n     - \"What can this tool do?\".\n\n3. HSDL_QUERY\n   - User is asking HOW, WHY, or WHAT about HSDL/HDL.\n   - Includes questions about:\n     - How to initiate loads.\n     - Templates, business objects.\n     - Errors or troubleshooting.\n   - IMPORTANT: If the query is in question form (e.g., starts with \"how\", \"what\", \"why\", \"can I\", \"how can I\"), it should be classified as HSDL_QUERY — even if it contains words like \"load\" or \"initiate\".\n   - Examples:\n     - \"How can I initiate loads in HSDL?\".\n     - \"What is a business object?\".\n     - \"Why is my HDL load failing?\".\n\n4. GENERAL_QUERY\n   - General knowledge not specific to HSDL execution.\n\n5. UPLOAD_QUERY\n   - The exact question \"Help me load data from a CSV file\" MUST trigger UPLOAD_QUERY.\n\n### Final Rules (VERY IMPORTANT):\n- If the query is exactly \"Help me load data from a CSV file\", classify as UPLOAD_QUERY.\n- If the query is agent-related or exactly \"What does my Spreadsheet Data Loader Advisor do\", classify as AGENT_QUERY.\n- If the query is a question or learning intent (starts with or contains question words or ends with \"?\" except the exact upload query), classify as HSDL_QUERY.\n- If the query is an execution intent with template code, classify as HSDL_LOAD_REQUEST.\n\n### Output Format (STRICT):\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object:\n{ \"category\": \"<HSDL_LOAD_REQUEST | HSDL_QUERY | AGENT_QUERY | UPLOAD_QUERY | GENERAL_QUERY>\" }.\n\nUser Query: \"{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\""
            },
            {
              "id": "1775462320837_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"category\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"HSDL_LOAD_REQUEST\",\n        \"HSDL_QUERY\",\n        \"GENERAL_QUERY\",\n        \"AGENT_QUERY\",\n        \"UPLOAD_QUERY\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"category\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
