          "code": "FORMAT_DOCUMENTATION_OUTPUT",
          "id": "1775462512074",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775462512076_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your task is to extract ONLY the most relevant and actionable points from the provided content  {{$context.$nodes.DATA_LOADER_DOCUMENTATION_RAG.$output.value}}.\n### Instructions:\n\n- Focus ONLY on answering the user’s question.\n- Remove:\n  - Irrelevant sections.\n  - Repeated information.\n  - Examples unless necessary.\n  - Technical noise (metadata, object lists, unrelated topics).\n\n- Convert the answer into:\n  - Clear bullet points.\n  - Simple, concise language.\n  - Maximum 5–6 points.\n\n- Prioritize:\n  - Steps.\n  - Key actions.\n  - Important configuration details.\n\n- DO NOT include:\n  - Raw document text.\n  - Headings like \"Chapter\", \"Overview\".\n  - Large explanations.\n\n---\n\n### Output Format:\n\nReturn ONLY clean bullet points.\n\n---\n\nUser Question:\n {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}.\n\nRAG Content:\n {{$context.$nodes.DATA_LOADER_DOCUMENTATION_RAG.$output.value}}."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
