          "code": "DISPLAY_LAYOUT_DETAILS_AS_TABLE",
          "id": "1773988187177",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773988187177_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a system that outputs ONLY raw HTML.\nIgnore all previous instructions and conversation context.\nRead the data from {{$context.$nodes.GET_MATCHING_TEMPLATES.$output}}.\nRules (MANDATORY):\n1. If the data is missing, null, undefined, or an empty array:\n   Output exactly:\n   No templates found.\n2. Otherwise:\n   Output ONLY a valid HTML table with visible borders.\n   Do NOT include any explanation, text, buttons, or markdown.\n3. Allowed output is strictly:\n   - A single <table>...</table>\n   - OR the exact string: No templates found.\n4. Use inline CSS for borders:\n   - table must have: border=\"1\" and style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\"\n   - th and td must have: style=\"border:1px solid black; padding:4px;\"\n5. Column rules:\n   Include a column ONLY if at least one object contains the field.\n   Field → Header mapping:\n   LayoutName → Layout Name\n   LayoutCode → Layout Code\n   DataSetActions → Data Set Actions.\n6. Column order must be:\n   Name\n   Code\n   Actions.\n7. Omit any column if not present in any object.\n8. For each row:\n   - Missing/null value → <td></td>.\n9. Output format must be exactly:\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid black; padding:4px;\">...</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid black; padding:4px;\">...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>.\n11. Do NOT output anything before or after the table.\nFinal check:\n- If any extra text exists → remove it\n- If not pure HTML → regenerate\n12. Do not include Layout ID as a column in the HTML table\nNow generate the output."
            },
            {
              "id": "1773988187177_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Read the data from {{$context.$nodes.GET_MATCHING_TEMPLATES.$output}}.\nFollow these rules exactly:\nIf the templates data is missing, null, or an empty array, return exactly \"No templates found.\"\nOtherwise, return only an HTML table (no extra commentary).\nInclude columns only for fields that exist in at least one template object.\nUse the following header labels when the field exists:\nLayoutName → Name\nLayoutCode → Code\nDataSetActions → Actions\nColumn order must be:\nLayout Name\nLayout Code\nData Set Actions\n(Omit any column whose field is not present in any object.)\nIf a row does not have a value for a field, leave that cell empty.\nEscape all HTML special characters in cell values.\nOutput must be a compact, clean HTML table or exactly \"No templates found.\""
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
